# ESP-IDF build output (regenerated by `idf.py build`)
**/build/

# Fully-resolved config (regenerated by `idf.py set-target` / menuconfig)
# — sdkconfig.defaults* is the intentional, committed config; this isn't
**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old

# Auto-downloaded component-manager dependencies — regenerated from
# idf_component.yml + dependencies.lock, don't hand-touch or commit
**/managed_components/

# VS Code editor state — contains absolute paths to *your* toolchain
# install, meaningless on someone else's machine
**/.vscode/

# Python/OS cruft
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.DS_Store